  "historyNote": "#2234, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2930, eff 12-21-84, EXPIRED: 12-21-90 New. #5143, eff 5-6-91; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-05 New. #8470, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06 New. #8625, eff 5-6-06; ss by #8946, eff 7-21-07; renumbered by #10081 (formerly Emp 302.01); ss by #10973, eff 11-12-15; ss by #14638, eff 6-26-26, EXPIRES 6-26-36",
